<!--
    Notification small icon. Android tints small icons to a flat silhouette
    everywhere they appear, reading only the alpha channel, so this carries no
    colour: one even-odd path where the arch wall fills, the opening cuts out,
    and the lock — nested one level deeper — fills again.

    20dp of mark on the 24dp canvas, matching the 2dp padding Material icons
    use. Scaled from AppIcon-source.svg by 20/656 about the mark's bounding box
    (x 262..762, y 220..876).
-->
